# Wall of Shards: "Cumulative upkeep--An opponent gains 1 life." With two opponents Bot1 chooses which gains the life, separately
# for each age counter (its ruling: "a different opponent for each age counter, or the same opponent multiple times"). At Bot1's
# turn 4 upkeep Bot3 gains 1 life; at turn 7 the two counters cost one life each, to Bot2 and to Bot3. Bot2 ends at 21, Bot3 at 22.

[Bot1 Deck]
Wall of Shards
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Bot3 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Wall of Shards.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T4 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot3.Pass
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.ChoosePlayer(Bot3)
Bot1.Pass
? Bot3.Life = 21
? Bot2.Life = 20
[T7 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot3.Pass
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.ChoosePlayer(Bot2)
Bot1.ChoosePlayer(Bot3)
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Wall of Shards.Counters.Age = 2

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 21
Bot3.Life = 22
